WEBVTT

00:00:15.705 --> 00:00:17.545
The horizon floats by above us,

00:00:17.545 --> 00:00:19.385
Sprinkling us with black tears,

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.385
And we, like Murakami’s characters,

00:00:21.385 --> 00:00:23.785
Don’t know which is reality and which is a dream

00:00:23.785 --> 00:00:25.225
Tell me, why is it among the gravestones

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:27.225
Of civilizations never committed to the earth

00:00:27.225 --> 00:00:29.570
That you and I have happened to end up

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.490
The last ones to bury them?

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:35.310
Before us, don’t stop, before us, go now,

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:39.250
All of life is now, all of life is a game

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:43.645
In our time the flood, in our time the war,

00:00:43.645 --> 00:00:46.905
And after us…

00:00:46.925 --> 00:00:50.845
Before us, don’t stop, before us, go now,

00:00:50.845 --> 00:00:54.765
All of life is now, all of life is a game

00:00:54.765 --> 00:00:59.150
In our time the flood, in our time the war,

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.370
And after us…
